# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[first]]-[[year]] [[student]].
#* {{quote-book|en|author=w:Alan Bleasdale|title=No More Sitting on the Old School Bench|location=Huddersfield, W.Y.|publisher=Woodhouse Books|year=1979|year_published=1983|page=30|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/alanbleasdale0000unse/page/30/mode/1up|isbn=0 906657 05 9|passage=Another thing you should know about is that the '''first years''' always stand with the teachers on the first day.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|author=Helen Ryan|title=A Year in the Life of Rachel|location=[Drogheda]|publisher=Choice Publishing & Book Services Ltd|year=2007|page=54|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/yearinlifeofrach0000ryan/page/54/mode/1up|isbn=978-1-905451-44-9|passage=There is a rumour going round the school that Claire Miles is throwing a party at Easter to celebrate her pregnancy. {{...}} Of course it might not be true about the party. The stupid '''first years''' are always getting things wrong.}}
# {{lb|en|uncountable|Philippines|education|historical}} The [[first]] [[year]] of [[high school]]; [[seventh grade]] {{q|now [[grade seven|grade 7]] of [[junior high school]]}}.
# {{&lit|en}}
#* {{quote-book|en|editor=Christopher Brickell|title=The {{w|Royal Horticultural Society}} Encyclopedia of Gardening|location=London|publisher=BCA by arrangement with [[w:DK (publisher)|Dorling Kindersley]]|year=1992|year_published=1994|page=207|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/royalhorticultur0000unse/page/207/mode/1up|column=1|isbn=9780863189791|passage=The use of sterilized compost when planting should minimize problems with weeds, at least for the '''first years'''.}}

